00:020:06.000 --> 00:020:19.000
After congratulating most of you, there are a few individuals who I'm afraid may go to hell.

00:020:19.000 --> 00:020:25.000
If they're guided, they will love me for saying... for saying this.

00:020:25.000 --> 00:020:27.000
If they're not guided, they will hate me.

00:020:27.000 --> 00:020:29.000
which doesn't make any difference.

