Sophie: ...I said, Rashad, you say LA ILAHA ILLA ALLAH; even though I was brought up, I was very impressed with Sunni Islam.

00:036:29.000 --> 00:036:35.000
I said, you say LA ILLAHA ILLA ALLAH, you're welcome in my home and you don't go stay in a hotel.

