00:037:22.000 --> 00:037:36.000
The messenger: Well, fine. I didn't see... you can explain it as much as you want... as much as you want but I can't help worrying about you when you have people opposing God and opposing God's messenger in your house.

00:037:36.000 --> 00:037:45.000
