So if you find - just a minute - I want to share a principle with all of you,

00:039:18.000 --> 00:039:26.000
that, like I said, God says say I'm a human being like you which means I'm not perfect,

00:039:26.000 --> 00:039:28.000
just like you, I pick my nose.

