The messenger: No, no. There is something I want to say. What I want to share with you is, if you see me as a bad person, then it is your tough luck.

00:039:53.000 --> 00:039:57.000
If you see me as a perfect person, it's because God wants to guide you;

00:039:57.000 --> 00:040:01.000
