and you are really dumb and stupid and you could not say a thing to this person to help him

00:040:13.000 --> 00:040:18.000
and as soon as this person leaves, you remember all the verses in the Quran and the things that you needed.

00:040:18.000 --> 00:040:24.000
It's tough luck for that person. That person would leave thinking that you're a stupid person.

00:040:24.000 --> 00:040:32.000
